            "notes": "We already have a lot of flexibility in Round 2.\n\nIf you are poor, get [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) and then best available fill.\n\nIf you have average dollars, I like to get [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) to continue doing damage and getting dollars. If they have a Reinheart or a good Sigma, consider [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) instead to get your damage by bombing over barriers.\n\nIf you are rich, get an early [Stacked Sticks](item_2ad5dace-ac3c-43fe-b20b-3add489a7207) (also a good chocie vs. Rein/Sigma). Bonus points if you're rich enough to pair with [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2).\n\nWhy not rush Stacked Sticks? I'd rather have the 20 Weapon and 10 Ability vs. just the 15 Ability, even with the more reliable Dynamite.",
