            "notes": "This is the time I will get [Stacked Sticks](item_2ad5dace-ac3c-43fe-b20b-3add489a7207) to light more fires (hell yeah!). The ability power is also a nice bonus.\n\nIf you are dying too much or just need a little pressure relief, [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) is a great booster that provides awesome survivability when you get jumped and can save you from a burst kill. Fantastic piece of the kit.\n\nYou should also swap out [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) at this point. If you picked [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) earlier, then maybe keep Talon. Guage whether you are hitting more shots or lighting more fires.\n\nAt this point you will want to start burning a Coach Gun shot just to light fires. If you are getting dove, do this judiciously when you have the chance.",
