            "notes": "If you are dying and need the survival, go [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121). If you are fine and need more damage, go [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262).\n\nMost of the time I go [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) because people are killers.\n\nThis is a relatively inexpensive build to this point, so fill in best available. Don't be afraid to sell a green to hit a blue item breakpoint. Choose what you can afford between [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2).",
