            "notes": "At this point you want to take [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df). Crazy damage and great against flankers. It's best if folks are geting in close, so if you're in the rare game where you are able to stay in the back without getting dove, then think about [Early Detonation](item_9e8a8aad-96a1-4068-994c-be0d3750469b) instead.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) goes here every game. Don't get it earlier; you need the Ability Power to make it worth it. The lifesteal keeps you alive, and the bonus 100 overheal is a phenomenal bonus.\n\nI would swap out [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) with [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262) here, if you don't already have it (remember, it also effectively boosts your Weapon Damage!).\n\nPadding out the life steal with [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) and/or [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) will make you feel invincible.",
